                                "sense_id": "2a64cf07-76ed-319a-8fda-512ce907f159",
                                "text": "Pretty soon I struck into a sort of path[…]. It twisted and turned,[…]and opened out into a big clear space like a lawn. And, back of the lawn, was a big, old-fashioned house, with piazzas stretching in front of it, and all blazing with lights."
                            }
                        ]
